        "description": "Substitute values to find ΔHθ.",
        "expression": "ΔHθ = -10.5 kJ - (-1)(8.314 x 10^{-3} kJ K^{-1} mol^{-1})(298 K) = -12.98 kJ"
      },
      {
        "step_number": 3,
        "description": "Calculate ΔGθ using ΔHθ and ΔSθ.",
        "expression": "ΔGθ = ΔHθ - TΔSθ"
      },
      {
        "step_number": 4,
        "description": "Substitute values to find ΔGθ.",
        "expression": "ΔGθ = -12.98 kJ - (298 K)(-44.1 J K^{-1}) = +0.16 kJ"
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "Therefore, the reaction will not occur spontaneously.",
